sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant WebClient
    participant API
    participant Database
    participant Model

    User->>WebClient: Choose protein and tile
    WebClient->>API: POST /v1/predict
    API->>Database: Look up tile and measured PSI
    Database-->>API: Tile sequence and domain status
    API->>Model: Score 532 substitutions
    Model-->>API: Scores and calibrated probabilities
    API-->>WebClient: 200 matrix, ranking, provenance, warnings
    WebClient-->>User: Show domain status, then heatmap
